    fibfib(0) == 0
    fibfib(1) == 0
    fibfib(2) == 1
    fibfib(n) == fibfib(n-1) + fibfib(n-2) + fibfib(n-3).
    Please write a function to efficiently compute the n-th element of the fibfib number sequence.
    >>> fibfib(1)
    0
    >>> fibfib(5)
    4
    >>> fibfib(8)
    24
    """
    @lru_cache(maxsize=None)
    def helper(x):
        if x == 0 or x == 1:
            return 0
        elif x == 2:
            return 1
        else:
            return helper(x-1) + helper(x-2) + helper(x-3)

    return helper(n)
```

